---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About — Raconteur"
    description="The story behind Raconteur, a home for storytellers."
>
    <article class="about">
        <header class="about-header">
            <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
            <h1>The story behind Raconteur</h1>
        </header>

        <div class="about-body">
            <p class="lede">
                The idea of Raconteur began with a passing thought and a simple need to own 
                a short story publishing site where it can run, work and function the way I envisioned.
                A site dedicated to the art of writing and the love for reading. A site dedicated to writers and readers.  
            </p>

            <p>
                So after several iterations, this is the result. A website where the only thing
                that matters is the writing. Where a six-hundred-word flash piece sits
                with the same dignity as a 14 line poety or a forty-thousand-word novella. 
                Where dark mode exists because reading at midnight should feel like reading at
                midnight, not like staring into a flashlight.
            </p>

            <h2>What you'll find here</h2>

            <p>
                Short stories, literary fiction, flash, poetry and novella.
            </p>

            <p>
                There are no likes to chase here (You sure bud? because there are like buttons on each stories and you should definitely give a like to celebrate each story). 
                No follower counts to inflate (that's a lie because there are follow buttons, so you should definitely follow each other).
                No share buttons to abuse (ahem! oh my lawd, he can lie because you can share your stories and account to everyone)
                No comment sections to...(Just stop the cap 🙄)
                Nonetheless, beyond the likes, the follows, comments and the sharing, this is a site where writers publish work they're proud of, and readers showing up for the love of the game itself.
            </p>

            <p>
                So, if this looks like a place you'd want to write, or read, create an account and start writing.
                Cheers!
            </p>

            <div class="signature">
                <p class="sign-off">— Nzan Kikon</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    :global(body) {
        background-color: #1e2420;
        color: #e4ddc8;
    }

    .about {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem;
    }

    .about-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
        padding-bottom: 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e8dcc5;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        font-style: italic;
        color: #a8b89c;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
        font-weight: 900;
        color: #f4ede0;
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .about-body {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .about-body p {
        margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
        text-align: justify;
        hyphens: none;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-break: normal;
    }

    .lede {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        color: #e4ddc8;
        line-height: 1.7;
        text-align: justify;
        hyphens: none;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-break: normal;
    }

    .about-body h2 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
        color: #a8b89c;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .about-body em {
        font-style: italic;
        color: #c8b890;
    }

    .signature {
        margin-top: 4rem;
        padding-top: 2rem;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(228, 221, 200, 0.25);
        color: #d8d0bc;
        text-align: right;
    }

    .sign-off {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: #c8b890;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .about { padding: 2rem 1.2rem 4rem; }
        .about-body { font-size: 1.05rem; }
        .lede { font-size: 1.15rem; }
    }
</style>